.TH HERDSMAN-IMPORT 1 "" "herdsman" "herdsman manual"
.SH NAME
herdsman-import \- Rebuild an account from an export.
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
usage: herdsman import <export> [--state-dir <path>]

Rebuilds an account from an export into an empty state directory, which must
have no daemon running on it.

exit codes:
  0  imported
  1  refused or failed
  2  bad usage
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR herdsman (1)
